        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/e7d6e5976a7daddd7d9e285addde2597.poster.avif?t=1759881617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/e7d6e5976a7daddd7d9e285addde2597.webm?t=1759881617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/e7d6e5976a7daddd7d9e285addde2597.mp4?t=1759881617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>&quot;Brother, may I have some OATS?&quot; </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convince a stubborn pig to part with his precious oats. You’ve got ten minutes, good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/a710b5094533a9587ae46f43a55a1194.avif?t=1759881617\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras_big/a710b5094533a9587ae46f43a55a1194.webp?t=1759881617 width=1560 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pig runs on a lightweight local AI model, he’ll remember what you say and push back in his own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different strategies every run to get him to hand over his oats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten minutes on the clock. Can you break him before time runs out?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get this to run consumer hardware some sacrifices had to be made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/ca434cf0496abf3f4a292d331ffb69aa.avif?t=1759881617\" width=1270 height=994 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/7ee7dd3fef9eb73d8925e9a96d8afa87.avif?t=1759881617\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras_big/7ee7dd3fef9eb73d8925e9a96d8afa87.webp?t=1759881617 width=1560 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is highly experimental, and is for people that are interested in seeing what the future of AI powered NPCs in games could look like, so there will be some jank.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/e7d6e5976a7daddd7d9e285addde2597.poster.avif?t=1759881617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/e7d6e5976a7daddd7d9e285addde2597.webm?t=1759881617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/e7d6e5976a7daddd7d9e285addde2597.mp4?t=1759881617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>&quot;Brother, may I have some OATS?&quot; </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convince a stubborn pig to part with his precious oats. You’ve got ten minutes, good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/a710b5094533a9587ae46f43a55a1194.avif?t=1759881617\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras_big/a710b5094533a9587ae46f43a55a1194.webp?t=1759881617 width=1560 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pig runs on a lightweight local AI model, he’ll remember what you say and push back in his own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different strategies every run to get him to hand over his oats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten minutes on the clock. Can you break him before time runs out?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get this to run consumer hardware some sacrifices had to be made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/ca434cf0496abf3f4a292d331ffb69aa.avif?t=1759881617\" width=1270 height=994 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras/7ee7dd3fef9eb73d8925e9a96d8afa87.avif?t=1759881617\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191280/extras_big/7ee7dd3fef9eb73d8925e9a96d8afa87.webp?t=1759881617 width=1560 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is highly experimental, and is for people that are interested in seeing what the future of AI powered NPCs in games could look like, so there will be some jank.</p>",
